From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yi Xie <imxieyi@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 17:14:49 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] kosmickrisp: embed LLVM-free build shaders

The Apple product build keeps LLVM out of its production dependency
closure, so it cannot run mesa_clc. Carry libkk.spv and libpoly.spv as
prebuilt mesa_clc output and build the device library from them instead of
from the OpenCL sources; vtn_bindgen2 still builds for KosmicKrisp, which
turns the SPIR-V into the NIR the driver links.

The blobs are the output of the maintaining project's
dependencies/kosmickrisp-spirv/generate.py for the sources at the head of
the series, not at this topic, so a replay of the topics between this one
and the last input edit builds kernels whose source it does not have yet.
---
 meson.build                       |   1 -
 src/compiler/spirv/meson.build    |   1 +
 src/kosmickrisp/libkk/libkk.spv   | Bin 0 -> 393180 bytes
 src/kosmickrisp/libkk/meson.build |  27 +++++++++++----------------
 src/poly/cl/libpoly.spv           | Bin 0 -> 67100 bytes
 src/poly/cl/meson.build           |  19 ++++---------------
 6 files changed, 16 insertions(+), 32 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 src/kosmickrisp/libkk/libkk.spv
 create mode 100644 src/poly/cl/libpoly.spv

diff --git a/meson.build b/meson.build
index 37f2fd47925d6d16b65acc314359ee7512d4a84f..32c620b997d8ec9d4392ffadc8bd1b685491f44a 100644
--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -959,7 +959,6 @@ with_driver_using_cl = [
   with_gallium_panfrost, with_panfrost_vk,
   with_gallium_rusticl,
   with_nouveau_vk, with_imagination_vk,
-  with_kosmickrisp_vk,
 ].contains(true)
 
 if get_option('mesa-clc') == 'system'
diff --git a/src/compiler/spirv/meson.build b/src/compiler/spirv/meson.build
index b49d3af6f3143845c3538e27fa28a73b273610e3..83e72020b1c6988ba0180b66e8ce286503b61ccb 100644
--- a/src/compiler/spirv/meson.build
+++ b/src/compiler/spirv/meson.build
@@ -79,6 +79,7 @@ spirv2nir = executable(
 )
 
 if get_option('mesa-clc') != 'system' and (with_driver_using_cl or \
+                                           with_kosmickrisp_vk or \
                                            get_option('install-mesa-clc'))
    prog_vtn_bindgen2 = executable(
      'vtn_bindgen2',
diff --git a/src/kosmickrisp/libkk/libkk.spv b/src/kosmickrisp/libkk/libkk.spv
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..e2abdc24e8a82952ba8b6a7e4ee3bd6b81aa11c7
GIT binary patch
